# Transit Gateway Routing Claims

This directory contains Transit Gateway routing infrastructure claims deployed via ArgoCD.

## Directory Structure

```
routing/
├── transit-gateways/     # Transit Gateway resources
├── attachments/          # VPC attachment resources
└── route-tables/         # Route table resources
```

## Deployment Order

Resources are deployed with ArgoCD sync-wave annotations:
- Wave 10: Transit Gateways
- Wave 20: VPC Attachments
- Wave 30: Route Tables

This ensures proper dependency ordering during GitOps sync.

## Examples

See `examples/routing/phase1/` and `examples/routing/phase2/` for reference implementations.
